      "evidence": "The 2025 Fenton survey locates the Class of 1920 gift to the east of the hall. The 2008 site preservation plan and 2013 photo show the fluted pedestal, four arms and four bowls. The pad is placed along the east edge of the modeled walk using the approximate survey location. The plan position, height and width are estimates.",
